# 懵然不知
(pos:形容詞)
<explanation>
yue:唔知道嘢嘅，冇頭緒嘅，好似懵住咁
eng:ignorant, unaware, oblivious
<eg>
yue:佢懵然不知我哋講咩嘢。 (keoi5 mong6 jin4 bat1 zi1 ngo5 dei6 gong2 me1 je5.)
eng:He is oblivious to what we are saying.

yue:懵然不知嘅人唔會明你講咩。 (mong6 jin4 bat1 zi1 ge3 jan4 m4 wui5 ming4 nei5 gong2 me1.)
eng:A person who is oblivious won't understand what you're saying. [end of text]


